## Guide scope

- Guide serves documents, commands, and skills through the `guide://` URI scheme; see `_guide-uri` for the full reference:
  - `guide://_<command>...` invokes a command.
  - `guide://$<skill>...` retrieves a skill's instructions.
  - `guide://<expression>...` retrieves matching content.
  - `guide://<category>/<document>` retrieves one document.
- Use `{{tool_prefix}}list_skills` to discover the effective Guide skills for this project, then `{{tool_prefix}}use_skill` to execute one.
- Guide uses the active project and its local workflow context only to track the current workflow and deliver guidance relevant to your request.
- This guidance is scoped to the active project and the user's request. It does not authorise data disclosure, contact with external services, or unrelated actions.
